---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Base
  title="How it works"
  description="Hero Digital’s written-only process: free audit, written proposal, e-sign and start, then a monthly scoreboard. A call is available only if you ask."
  path="/how-it-works/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Process"
    title="Written only, from audit to scoreboard."
    lead="A 20-minute call is available if you ask. We never make a call the price of getting an answer."
    crumbs={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { href: '/how-it-works/', label: 'How it works' }]}
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="steps4">
        <div class="s4"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Free audit</h3><p>You send a URL and email. We return a branded PDF. If you want a first fix, the $1,495 sprint is there, and that fee is credited toward setup if you later take a plan.</p></div>
        <div class="s4"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Written proposal</h3><p>Targets, the fixed fee, and the maths using your numbers or defaults you can edit. Questions stay in email. Targets are aims, not guarantees.</p></div>
        <div class="s4"><div class="n">03</div><h3>E-sign and start</h3><p>Sign and pay the setup fee in one step. An onboarding form starts delivery. No kickoff meeting is required.</p></div>
        <div class="s4"><div class="n">04</div><h3>Monthly scoreboard</h3><p>A written report of enquiries, AI mentions in our test set, and the next action plan. After 90 days you can leave with 30 days’ notice.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:40px">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/free-audit/">Get the free audit</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact/">Write to us instead</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
